export const environments=[{name:'Wilderness Gate',unlock:0},{name:'Cedar Highlands',unlock:5},{name:'Sea of Starlight',unlock:15},{name:'Citadel of Wisdom',unlock:30},{name:'Master’s Observatory',unlock:50}];
// All artwork is original, pre-rendered at integer pixel resolution.
export const sword=`<img class="pixel-sword" src="assets/console/sword.png" width="48" height="112" alt="" aria-hidden="true">`;
export function landscape(env=0){env=Math.max(0,Math.min(4,Math.floor(env)));return `<div class="landscape env-${env}" aria-hidden="true"><div class="world-plane"><img class="world-raster" src="assets/console/world-${env}.png" width="640" height="280" alt=""><span class="pixel-fire fire-left"></span><span class="pixel-fire fire-right"></span><span class="world-glint glint-one"></span><span class="world-glint glint-two"></span></div></div>`}
